msgid "Declare this device as an exit node, allowing other nodes to route all traffic through it (--advertise-exit-node)."
msgstr "将此设备声明为出口节点，允许其他节点通过本设备中转全部流量 (--advertise-exit-node)。"

msgid "When using or advertising the exit node, allow access to the local LAN (--exit-node-allow-lan-access)."
msgstr "在使用或通告出口节点时，允许访问本地局域网设备 (--exit-node-allow-lan-access)。"

msgid "Allow connecting to this device through the native SSH function of Tailscale (--ssh)."
msgstr "允许通过 Tailscale 的原生 SSH 功能安全连接到此设备 (--ssh)。"

msgid "When enabled, blocks all inbound connections from the Tailscale network (--shields-up)."
msgstr "启用后，阻止来自 Tailnet 网络的所有主动入站连接 (--shields-up)。"

msgid "Controls how Tailscale DNS is handled (--accept-dns)."
msgstr "控制 Tailscale MagicDNS 与本地 DNS 的处理方式 (--accept-dns)。"

msgid "Enable this device as a Peer Relay server (--peer-relay). Requires a public IP and an UDP port open on the router."
msgstr "启用本设备作为 Peer Relay 节点 (--peer-relay)。需要公网 IP 并开放路由器的 UDP 端口。"

msgid "UDP port for the Peer Relay service (--peer-relay-port). Open this port on your router firewall/NAT."
msgstr "Peer Relay 服务的 UDP 监听端口 (--peer-relay-port)。请在路由器防火墙或 NAT 中放行该端口。"

msgid "Select an exit node from the list (--exit-node). If enabled, Allow LAN Access is enabled implicitly."
msgstr "从列表中选择要连接的出口节点 (--exit-node)。如果启用，将隐式允许访问本地局域网。"

msgid "Announce subnet routes behind this device (--advertise-routes). Select from the detected subnets below or enter custom routes (comma-separated)."
msgstr "向 Tailnet 通告本设备后方的子网路由 (--advertise-routes)。从下方检测到的子网中选择或手动输入自定义路由（逗号分隔）。"

msgid "Optional: Specify a custom control server URL (e.g., a Headscale instance, --login-server). Leave blank for default Tailscale control plane."
msgstr "可选：指定自定义控制服务器地址（例如 Headscale 实例，--login-server）。留空则使用 Tailscale 官方服务器。"

msgid "Optional: Specify an authentication key for the custom control server (--auth-key). Leave blank if not required."
msgstr "可选：指定自定义控制服务器的预认证密钥（--auth-key）。留空则无需认证密钥。"
